hadiths[6]{hadithnumber,text}:
"365","[AI-translation] Saeed bin Abdur Rahman Makhzoomi aur ghair-e-wahid se riwayat hai, kehne lage: Haddasana Sufyan, an-az-Zuhri, an Muhammad bin Jubair bin Mut'im, an abihi, ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alayhi wasallam) ne farmaya: Mere naam hain, main Muhammad hoon, aur main Ahmad hoon, aur main Mahi hoon jis ke zariye Allah kufr ko mitta dega, aur main Hashir hoon jis ke qadam par log hashar kiye jayenge, aur main Aaqib hoon jis ke baad koi nabi nahi."
"366","[AI-translation] Hamein Muhammad bin Turaif Kufi ne hadess sunayi, kaha: Hamein Abu Bakr bin Ayyash ne hadess sunayi, Asim se, Abi Wa'il se, Hudaifa se, kaha: Main ne Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se Madine ke kuch raston par mulaqat ki, to farmaya: Main Muhammad hoon, main Ahmad hoon, main rehmat ka nabi hoon, tauba ka nabi hoon, main Muqaffa hoon, main Hashir hoon, aur Malahim ka nabi hoon. Hamein Ishaq bin Mansur ne hadess sunayi, kaha: Hamein Nadr bin Shumail ne hadess sunayi, kaha: Hamein Hammad bin Salama ne khabar di, Asim se, Zirr se, Hudaifa se, Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se, isi ki tarah is ke maani ke saath, isi tarah. Hammad bin Salama ne kaha, Asim se, Zirr se, Hudaifa se."
"367","[AI-translation] Hamein Muhammad bin Tarif Kufi ne hadees suna'i, kahaa: Hamein Abu Bakr bin Ayyash ne hadees suna'i, Asim se, Abi Wa'il se, Huzaifa se, kahaa: Main Nabi Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam se Madine ke kuch raston mein mila, toh Aapne farmaya: Main Muhammad hoon, aur main Ahmad hoon, aur main Rehmat ka Nabi hoon, aur Tauba ka Nabi hoon, aur main Muqaffa hoon, aur main Hashir hoon, aur Malahim ka Nabi hoon. Hamein Ishaq bin Mansoor ne hadees suna'i, kahaa: Hamein Nadar bin Shumail ne hadees suna'i, kahaa: Hamein Hammad bin Salama ne khabar di, Asim se, Zirr se, Huzaifa se, Nabi Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam se, isi ki tarah iske maani mein, yunhi. Hammad bin Salama ne kahaa, Asim se, Zirr se, Huzaifa se."
"368","[AI-translation] Haddasana Qutaibah bin Sa'eed, haddasana Hammad bin Zaid, 'an Ayyub, 'an Muhammad bin Sirin, qeede: Hum Abu Hurairah radiyallahu 'anhu ke paas the aur un par do katan ke kapde the, to un mein se ek mein unhone funkar maara. To Abu Hurairah ne farmaya: Bakh bakh! Abu Hurairah katan ke kapde mein funkarta hai. Main ne khud ko dekha hai ke main Rasoolullah sallallahu 'alayhi wasallam ke minbar aur Aishah radiyallahu 'anha ke hujre ke darmiyan behosh girta tha, to aane wala aata tha aur apna pao mere gardan par rakh deta tha, samajhta tha ke mujhe junoon hai, halanke mujhe junoon nahi tha, balki yeh to sirf bhook hi thi."
"369","[AI-translation] Haddasana Qutaibah, haddasana Ja'far bin Sulaiman al-Duba'i, 'an Malik bin Dinar, farmate hain: Rasoolullah sallallahu 'alayhi wasallam ne kabhi roti aur gosht se pet bhar kar nahi khaya, illa ke thore thore tukdon ki soorat mein."
"370","[AI-translation] Qutayba bin Sa'id ne hamein hadith bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Abu al-Ahwas ne hamein hadith bayan ki, Simak bin Harb se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne an-Nu'man bin Bashir ko yeh kehte hue suna: Kya tum khane aur peene mein jo chaho nahi pa rahe? Main ne tumhare Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ko dekha, aur unhein saste khajoor (ad-daqal) se bhi woh nahi milta tha jo un ka pet bhar de."
